{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_09_end",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_09",
  "title": "“冬藏”",
  "storyCode": "WB-9",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b44e273758df29371e8706e810adf83a255e1748466bbebdc6c102ab4b32f4c5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g12_huanjing"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g12_huanjing"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那是第二次，在漫長的混沌中跋涉。\n在跋涉的盡頭甦醒——\n懊悔。屈辱。不甘。渾噩。\n......\n更多的是，困惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g12_huanjing"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你要留我，那就替祂，回答我的問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了見你，我一路走來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可知道，目之所見，那些愚妄的螻蟻，挖開岩脈，鑿穿河床，山嶽湖澤，清濁倒易，他們將那些猙獰的瘡疤，命名為城市......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這片早已病變的土地，還是我們曾棲居嬉遊的宇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可知道，這座名為玉門的醜陋城市，磚牆上還留著當初祂們臨死前烙下的爪痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千年以來，那群螻蟻至今不曾修補那一塊地方，視之為榮耀，視之為文明的巍峨里程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你的碎片，如今卻在守護這樣一座城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是我，祂是祂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（天地的隱怒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "船仍在行進。\n兩岸的草木矮去幾分，雪壓得更低了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可還記得，我們的意識如何跋涉於無寐的混沌，成為此間最初的生靈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可還記得，我們如何注視著鴻蒙升落，時得其序，物分其列，天地慢慢有了天地的樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可還記得，那破開雲靄的眼睛？我們在蒼穹間對視，碰撞，川江淤赤，群山夷為平地，伏屍聳入雲霄，潰膿腐爛後化作新的峰嶺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是何等壯闊的，真正的，戰爭？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（天地的隱怒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "船仍在行進，江面隨著船頭延伸，永無止境。\n積雪更深，每一句發問，回聲都如同雪崩。\n上下皆白，天穹低得觸手可及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "經歷過那樣的時代，為何還會在意自己鱗爪間的螻蟻，和螻蟻撲騰起的塵埃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了愚弄人類，你吹雲作雨，降下可笑的“祥瑞”，助所謂的真龍贏下征伐，本就無聊至極......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又為何千年之後，再次回應他們？驚擾、挑唆、圍逐、驅殺自己的，同類？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相比他們渺小卻勇敢的先族，這幫羸弱的、不堪的、骯髒的螻蟻，你為何想要成為他們的主宰——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成為他們可笑的“神”？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（天地的隱怒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "窮極寰宇，歷數太古以來無垠的時間，我們這樣的存在，可曾有過你這般恥辱？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "回答我，我的......同類！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很憤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在沉睡的數千年裡，祂也無時無刻不像現在的你一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吞咽屈辱，咀嚼背叛，追問答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然也不會有我們這些碎片的誕生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們已然不是祂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你的問題，我給不了答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我理解不了你的憤怒，正如你理解不了我的憤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "憤怒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你依然要為人類討要說法？在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拔出那把劍，或許還有可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在想，你是有多麼珍惜這個空間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g2_yumenstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g12_huanjing"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "春生夏榮秋傷冬藏，裁錯春秋，剪宇懷腹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我甚至能想像到，你在千年前逃離炎國時，是怎樣將這幾方小小的天地剪裁下來倉皇帶走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而後又是怎樣隱匿在這片大地上某個僻遠的角落，一遍又一遍地翻檢查看，就著永遠不會流逝的殘景舔舐傷口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巨獸，也變成了如此傷懷的一種生命？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這和你口中那般羸弱的、不堪的、骯髒的人類，又有什麼區別？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "八千年為春，八千年為秋，雪永遠不會停，這方天地永遠是這天地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是你們丈量時間的方式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是可笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "日、月、年。\n寒來暑往，一載春秋。\n無論多麼漫長的時間，也可以拆成一寸寸光陰。\n一心一意，一招一式，從三九到三伏，再到下一個三九。\n人類從來都是如此，將生命拆解成微末，再從微末中感受一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g12_huanjing"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "船停了——\n結結實實的拳頭，轟在睚的胸膛上。\n沒有多餘的動作，萬法歸一，武道至簡。\n漫天冰雪融作江心一點，睚的身體跌出小舟......\n重重砸在冷硬的地面上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g7_zuosroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是......你放棄祂的力量後習得的本事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的確不是祂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人沒有說話，他沉默地看著眼前奄奄一息的“人”。\n原來萬千生靈，在瀕死之時都是相似的姿態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼......不殺了我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "代理人的身軀，你可以隨意捏塑，毀掉了也沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開玉門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們還會再見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍，受災情況初步清點完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人員傷亡如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天災到來前，城東的百姓已經安全遷往城西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欽天監術師在核心內城正面對抗二次風暴，有近半數受傷。當時龍門的林先生林特使父女也在場相助......林先生受傷很重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已、已經送往軍營醫館。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林先生仗義出手，於玉門有大恩，全力救治，不容有失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "建築受損情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城西並未受到影響，南北兩區在天災最為嚴重時受風沙侵襲，部分建築有不同程度的損壞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城東直面沙塵與源石塵暴，情況最為嚴重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門四衛中兩組破損嚴重，失去了修補價值，土木天師已將其直接脫離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關鍵是基礎牆體也受到了影響，部分立面結構嚴重錯位，需要進行緊急加固。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他城防工事的折耗率在六成左右。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "土木天師是否有了結論？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根據幾位天師初步計算，以最快的速度修復牆體工事，至少需要兩個月的時間，玉門城才能重新恢復航行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩個月......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情況竟比災前預估的要好上一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚不清楚天災是否有餘波，全體軍士不可懈怠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繼續清點災情，送傷者就醫，增設臨時營帳，將百姓從城西避難點遷出妥善安置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城中的山海眾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山海眾試圖襲擊沙渠等城防工事、侵擾百姓來製造混亂，巡防營應對及時，加上武行的人出手相助，多數都已伏法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有少數人趁著牆體破壞逃出了城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但此前潛入軍營行刺的山海眾首領並沒有現身，已經增派人手進行搜捕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有現身？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以那人的本事，竟沒有趁亂做些什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宗師呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宗師去了一趟鑄劍坊後，人也不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g9_yumensuburb"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把這把劍塞給我，是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望閣下代為保管......算是一個請求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來就是為了這把劍，鬧得滿城風雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這到底是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "它的確有太多的身份。\n封印了歲獸十二分之一意識的器物，一段愛恨糾葛的見證，一把有些年頭的古劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以把它當作他日我們再戰的信物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要別再讓它被人偷去搶去，或是把它典當換錢就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這應該是件挺重要的物件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是閣下覺得為難的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在想......或許我們不算認識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你叫槐天裴，有兩位聰明的朋友，和一個伶俐的女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還知道你是從古至今，唯一一個贏了我一拳的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你是我習武四十年，唯一打不過的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這把劍，我帶著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我再練四十年，再來找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我等閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g13_yanlivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，我想向您打聽一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前留在您醫館的那位夥計，他還欠您多少藥錢，我替他還給您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算啦。都這麼久了，哪還欠我什麼錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無非是找個理由，讓他有個安身的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫忙做些救死扶傷的事，總好過整天打打殺殺的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常，謝謝您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是他女兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個人瘋瘋癲癲，居然有這麼一位知書達理的女兒，真是奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過少了這麼一位夥計，還真有點不習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看這一屋子落沙，我自己怎麼收拾得過來喲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我來幫您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是不告而別？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底還是他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過這次，我也不再急著去把他找出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來，接下來你也做好了打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偵探事務所那邊的工作我會繼續做，學業也會繼續。當然，武功更不會擱下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次再見他的時候，就不只是踢他下巴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g11_yumendesert"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上面來信，我們稍事整頓，趕赴下一個任務地點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜玉門城還是安然渡過了天災，而我們傷亡慘重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（冷哼聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "信函在蒙面男人的手中燃燒，紙張很快化為灰燼，但一小方金色浴火後反而更加奪目。\n那是特製的火漆，專供朝中一品要員，三公重卿，能使用者不超過五人。\n男人將火漆攥在手裡，把玩片刻後輕輕捏碎。細屑散入沙塵，消失不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來的任務，也只是製造一場足夠引起朝廷注意的動靜，玉門城還有大用，要真毀了，反倒得不償失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即刻撤離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不等先生嗎？這次沒她幫忙，我們很難成事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是諦獸......先生回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門城裡，有誰能讓先生受這麼重的傷？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個“人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打聽到別的消息沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諦獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（詭異的長鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多長時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諦獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（詭異的長鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩個月？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經知道了祂的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的目的......您究竟是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，我們恐怕要就此別過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別阻礙我做事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "再漫長的路也有終點。\n被喚醒後，我愈發清晰地感受到它的到來——所謂“大限”。\n那場圍獵中所受的傷，已不可能痊癒。\n你最好也已經醒了。\n我所剩無幾的時間，我所剩無幾的同類。\n我們要，做個了結。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
